### 查询资产（默认第一页）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets

### 按科室+状态筛选
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets?dept=信息科&status=RUNNING

### 新增资产
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetCode": "ZC-0022",
  "name":"",
  "category": "PRINTER",
  "dept": "信息科",
  "location": "行政楼4层",
  "criticalLevel": 3,
  "owner": "吴涛"
}

### 正常修改 (PUT id=24，改 name)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/assets/21
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "打印机",
  "category": "PRINTER",
  "dept": "信息科",
  "location": "行政楼5层",
  "criticalLevel": 2,
  "owner": "吴涛"
}

### 修改不存在的ID (PUT id=999)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/assets/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "幽灵设备",
  "category": "PRINTER",
  "dept": "信息科",
  "location": "虚空",
  "criticalLevel": 1,
  "owner": "没人"
}

### 正常删除 (DELETE id=24)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/assets/24

### 删除不存在的ID (DELETE id=999)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/assets/999

### 强行塞入 assetCode 测试严格模式
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/assets/24
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetCode": "ZC-9999",
  "name": "试图篡改编号",
  "category": "PRINTER",
  "dept": "信息科",
  "criticalLevel": 1,
  "owner": "吴涛"
}